        "text": "Skip to main content\nK\nKel\nNew Chat\nWork\nTeam\nProjects\nProviders\nAutonomy\nDiagnostics\nNo chat history\nWork & context\nSettings\nSkip to main content\nSet up Kel\n\nStep 2 of 5 · Providers\n\nSkip setup\nModel providers\nOpen Providers\nClaude (Claude Code) \nQueued · quota not reported · subscription\nCodex \nQueued · quota not reported · subscription\nAnthropic API \nWaiting on you · installed not authenticated · api key\nDeepSeek API \nWaiting on you · installed not authenticated · api key\n\nKel can be explored without a provider, but running a job needs one: a CLI subscription session, or an API key kept in Windows' protected store.\n\nBack\nNext",
